<title>HUNGARY: HUNGARY JULY CPI DOWN 0.1 PCT M/M, UP 18.1 PCT Y/Y.</title>
<headline>HUNGARY JULY CPI DOWN 0.1 PCT M/M, UP 18.1 PCT Y/Y.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's consumer prices in</p>
<p>July fell 0.1 percent month-on-month, and were up 18.1 percent</p>
<p>year-on-year, figures released by the Central Statistical</p>
<p>Office (KSH) showed on Monday.</p>
<p>    HUNGARY CONSUMER PRICES     July 1997  June 1996  July 1997</p>
<p>    Month-on-month change (pct)   -0.1	 +1.7	 +0.4</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change (pct)    +18.1	+18.7	+23.0</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
